    "knowledge_point": "Finding Unit Tangent Vectors Using the Rules of Differentiation For Vector Functions",
    "problem": "Find the unit tangent vector to the curve $r(t)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t\\,p(t)$ at the point corresponding to $t=-\\frac{\\pi }{6}$, given that  $p(-\\frac{\\pi }{6})=\\sqrt{3}\\,i+\\sqrt{3}\\,k$ and $\\,{p}^{′}(-\\frac{\\pi }{6})=-2\\,i-8\\,j+4\\,k.$",
    "worked_solution": "For a curve $r(t)=x(t)i+y(t)j+z(t)k$, the unit tangent vector $T(t)$ at the point $P(x(t),y(t),z(t))$ is given by\n\n$$\nT(t)=\\frac{{r}^{′}(t)}{‖{r}^{′}(t)‖}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we find ${r}^{′}(t)$ and evaluate it at $t=-\\frac{\\pi }{6}:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t\\,p(t)) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t)\\cdot p(t)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(p(t)) \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t\\,p(t)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t\\,{p}^{′}(t) \\\\ {r}^{′}(-\\frac{\\pi }{6}) & =-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-\\frac{\\pi }{3})p(-\\frac{\\pi }{6})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-\\frac{\\pi }{3}){p}^{′}(-\\frac{\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3}(\\sqrt{3}\\,i+\\sqrt{3}\\,k)+\\frac{1}{2}(-2\\,i-8\\,j+4\\,k) \\\\  & =(3\\,i+3\\,k)+(-\\,i-4\\,j+2\\,k) \\\\  & =2\\,i-4\\,j+5\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate the magnitude of ${r}^{′}(-\\frac{\\pi }{6}):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖{r}^{′}(-\\frac{\\pi }{6})‖ & =\\sqrt{(2)^{2}+(-4)^{2}+(5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{45} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we normalize ${r}^{′}(-\\frac{\\pi }{6}):$  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(-\\frac{\\pi }{6}) & =\\frac{{r}^{′}(-\\frac{\\pi }{6})}{‖{r}^{′}(-\\frac{\\pi }{6})‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{5}}\\cdot (2\\,i-4\\,j+5\\,k) \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{15}\\,i-\\frac{4\\sqrt{5}}{15}\\,j+\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the unit tangent vector to the curve at the point that corresponds to $t=-\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ is\n $T(-\\frac{\\pi }{6})=\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{15}\\,i-\\frac{4\\sqrt{5}}{15}\\,j+\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}\\,k.$",
